<tr><td>riverside coffee</td><td>Another name or place</td><td><span class="dfs-badge">#4</span></td><td class="dfs-num">1,300</td><td class="dfs-num">70</td><td><code>/blog/2023/03/riverside-coffee-opens/</code></td></tr>
<tr><td>best podcasts 2026</td><td>Unrelated</td><td><span class="dfs-badge">#18</span></td><td class="dfs-num">900</td><td class="dfs-num">5</td><td><code>/blog/podcasts</code></td></tr>
</tbody>
</table></div>
<h2 id="positions-title">Rankings by position</h2>
<p id="positions-note">11% of the 312 terms are on page three or later, where almost nobody clicks. Most visits come from page one.</p>
<div class="dfs-table" id="positions" tabindex="0"><table>
