<tr><td>#11 to #20</td><td>Page two. Few people look this far.</td><td class="dfs-num"><span class="dfs-bar" aria-hidden="true" style="--w:100"></span>50</td></tr>
<tr><td>#21 to #100</td><td>Page three or later. Almost no clicks.</td><td class="dfs-num"><span class="dfs-bar" aria-hidden="true" style="--w:68"></span>34</td></tr>
</tbody>
</table></div>
<h2 id="top-terms-title">Top search terms</h2>
