## How this was measured

- **What:** Where Acme Plumbing shows in Google Maps for “plumber”, “water heater repair” and “drain cleaning”, and who holds the top 3.
- **Where:** Searched from the center of Springfield, Illinois, United States, in English. Maps results change with the searcher’s location, so this is one snapshot.
